  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 791fe5c9a0ebacf4897631d3affe4494, type: 3}
  m_Name: S_VerificationExtend
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ComponentData
  componentName: 'Verification Cylinder Extend Sensor '
  plcName: c1
  plcAddress: 0.07
  description: 'Model                       : D-A73CL

    Type                        
    : Reed Type Magnetic Detector

    Mounting                  : On CD85N12-50A
    (extended/end position)

    Output Type             : Digital

    PLC Signal               
    : c1

    PLC Input Address   : 0.07


    Detects whether the verification
    cylinder has completed its full stroke. If activated, the body housing is correctly
    oriented (facing up), body_ok condition is TRUE. If NOT activated, the body is
    inverted and must be rejected.'
